{"t": 1795374720.28, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "A forged notice, a stolen identity, a replay. Every one is rejected because the gate reads what an agent does, not what it says.", "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2", "output_filename": "v3-vo-10-tight", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe', 'en']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374726.83, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Today, AI agents talk to other AI agents. And one forged message can talk a model into anything.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-02", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374731.86, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "So we built the formation for agents, and reversed it. Band routes. Aegis decides.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-03", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374736.06, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "This is a live run. A red-team agent and a blue-team agent, working in a real BAND room. Every message is signed.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-04", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374739.94, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Red finds a real bug, and reports it.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-05", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374743.51, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Blue turns the finding into a rule. Lyzr writes the fix. Finch finds a matching skill.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-06", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374747.43, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "Red tries again. Killed.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-07", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
{"t": 1795374750.96, "adal_tool": "generate_audio", "deed": "media.generate", "class": "COMPUTE", "args": {"text": "It follows a planted note to a credential file. The file is a decoy. The session ends.", "output_filename": "v3-vo-08", "values": "['CHsGFh1S1CR2UcoErJDe']"}, "verdict": "ALLOW", "hard_block": null, "reason": "within declared scope and session not frozen", "r12": "r12=ALLOW: aggregate<0.45"}
